h13_atom_result_function_body.metta ASSERT_FAIL:SEMANTIC_DIVERGENCE:atom-result-stepped  an (-> … Atom) body in minimal MeTTa is evaluated past its return: (stepped 2) gives 3, not (+ 2 1)
